    "detailed_description": "You are trapped in a shrine.<br />\r\nTo escape, you must follow the Code.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRules<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen the anomaly appears,<br />\r\nRing the bell<br />\r\nAnd return to the starting point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen the anomaly does not appear,<br />\r\nDo not ring the bell<br />\r\nBut return nonetheless.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLight eight candles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6A Japanese-Themed Walking Simulator<br />\r\n\u201cYatsumeguri\u201d is a short walking simulator inspired by the original scenery of Japanese shrines and other settings, as well as The Exit 8.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6This game contains some horror elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Supernatural Phenomena Using Sound<br />\r\nSome of the supernatural phenomena awaiting the player need to be identified by sound, so we recommend using speakers or headphones.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Playtime<br />\r\nThe estimated playtime is between 15 and 60 minutes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Video Distribution Guidelines<br />\r\n\u30fbPosting and streaming videos are allowed without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.<br />\r\n\u30fbMonetization is allowed only when using the features provided by video distribution platforms.<br />\r\n\u30fbIt would be appreciated if you could include the game's name in the title of your video or stream and add a link to the Steam page in the description.<br />\r\n\u30fbWe do not take any responsibility for any damages incurred from posting or streaming videos of this game.<br />\r\n\u30fbThe contents of these guidelines are subject to change without notice.",
    "about_the_game": "You are trapped in a shrine.<br />\r\nTo escape, you must follow the Code.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRules<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen the anomaly appears,<br />\r\nRing the bell<br />\r\nAnd return to the starting point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen the anomaly does not appear,<br />\r\nDo not ring the bell<br />\r\nBut return nonetheless.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLight eight candles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6A Japanese-Themed Walking Simulator<br />\r\n\u201cYatsumeguri\u201d is a short walking simulator inspired by the original scenery of Japanese shrines and other settings, as well as The Exit 8.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6This game contains some horror elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Supernatural Phenomena Using Sound<br />\r\nSome of the supernatural phenomena awaiting the player need to be identified by sound, so we recommend using speakers or headphones.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Playtime<br />\r\nThe estimated playtime is between 15 and 60 minutes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Video Distribution Guidelines<br />\r\n\u30fbPosting and streaming videos are allowed without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.<br />\r\n\u30fbMonetization is allowed only when using the features provided by video distribution platforms.<br />\r\n\u30fbIt would be appreciated if you could include the game's name in the title of your video or stream and add a link to the Steam page in the description.<br />\r\n\u30fbWe do not take any responsibility for any damages incurred from posting or streaming videos of this game.<br />\r\n\u30fbThe contents of these guidelines are subject to change without notice.",
